latform was probably built between A.D. 1200 and 1400, and it represents an open space that would have been used for public events that could have involved an entire subject polity (for the proxemics of Andean plazas, see Moore, 1996)." <br>Location of administrative and temple buildings <br>Qhapaqkancha<br>Markasunay<br>Pukara Pantillijlla<br>Kaytamarka<br>Warq\'ara<br>Ankasmarka'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2437, 'temperature': 0.2})
